senses.gloss:
शरावती N. of a town of which
Lava was made ruler by Rāma;
R. 15. 97.

शारंगी A particular musical
instrument (played with a bow);
cf. सारंगी.

शार्ंगिन् m.
1 An archer, a bowman.
--2 An epithet of Viṣṇu;
धर्मसंरक्षणार्थैव प्रवृत्तिर्भुवि शांर्गिणः R. 15. 4. 12. 70;
Me. 46.
--3 Of Śiva.
